my-research-website/
├── app/                  <-- Layouts, pages, and routes (URLs)
├── components/           <-- Reusable UI elements (buttons, navbar, modals)
├── lib/                  <-- YOUR MAIN CONTENT DATA FILE (lib/data.ts)
├── public/               <-- Uploaded files (PDFs, images, CSV datasets)
├── content/ (or posts/)  <-- Markdown files for thoughts/papers (if used)
├── package.json          <-- Installed packages list
└── tailwind.config.ts    <-- Color palettes, fonts, and theme settings
